Comando nativo PowerShell (più leggibile):
Get-PSDrive -PSProvider FileSystem | Select-Object Name, @{n="Free(GB)";e={[math]::Round($_.Free/1GB,2)}}, @{n="Used(GB)";e={[math]::Round($_.Used/1GB,2)}}
